----------
scriptunit-fragment 1
----------

var b = 125

----------
scriptunit-fragment 2
----------

set b = 500

----------
scriptunit-fragment 3
----------

set b = b + 1

----------
scriptunit-fragment 4
----------

let c = b * 2

----------
expect all four units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `b` = 501 |
| 2 | overwrites `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | - |
| 3 | updates `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | - |
| 4 | reads `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `c` = 1002 |

----------
scriptunit-delete 3
----------

----------
expect unit 3 is deleted
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | untouched | unit 2 overwrites `b` after it | `b` = 500 |
| 2 | overwrites `b` (1) | reruns | rerun: unit 3 updated `b` when it last ran, and is deleted, and unit 2 is the nearest to set it without reading it | - |
| 3 | updates `b` (1) | deleted | deleted | - |
| 4 | reads `b` (1) | reruns | reads `b` after unit 3, which no longer updates it | `c` = 1000 |
